
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>A Little Something for You ❤️</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600&display=swap');

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff0f5, #ffe0eb, #fff7f0);
  color: #70465a;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.screen {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 24px 18px;
  text-align: center;
}

.screen.active {
  display: flex;
  animation: appear 0.8s ease;
}

.content {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 430px;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #bc7897;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: #b94c78;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 8vw, 44px);
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 12px 0;
}

p {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.heart {
  font-size: 75px;
  display: inline-block;
  animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 12px #e8a1bd55);
}

button {
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 16px 27px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ed78a5, #d84f86);
  box-shadow: 0 9px 24px #d84f8640;
  transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

button:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 28px #d84f8655;
}

button:active {
  transform: scale(0.97);
}

.small-note {
  margin-top: 22px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #b47b96;
}

.card {
  background: #ffffffb8;
  border: 1px solid #ffffff;
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 27px 23px;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 50px #b84c7812;
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}

.love-letter {
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.95;
}

.love-letter p {
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.signature {
  text-align: center;
  color: #bd4e7d;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.floating-heart {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -30px;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 10;
  animation: floatUp linear forwards;
}

.hidden {
  display: none !important;
}

@keyframes heartbeat {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
  15% { transform: scale(1.12); }
  30% { transform: scale(1); }
  45% { transform: scale(1.08); }
}

@keyframes appear {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

@keyframes floatUp {
  0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
  15% { opacity: 0.9; }
  100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg); }
}

@media (max-width: 380px) {
  .card { padding: 23px 17px; }
  .love-letter { font-size: 14px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- FIRST SCREEN -->
<section class="screen active" id="first">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="eyebrow">A tiny surprise for my favourite human</div>

    <div class="heart">💌</div>

    <h1>Hey, you!</h1>

    <p>
      I have something to tell you.<br>
      But first, you have to answer one very important question...
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:19px; color:#9e466d; margin-top:25px;">
      Do you love me? 🥹
    </h2>

    <button onclick="openLove()">Click me if you love me 💗</button>

    <div class="small-note">P.S. There's only one right answer. Hehe. ♡</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LOVE LETTER SCREEN -->
<section class="screen" id="second">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Just for you, always ♡</div>

    <div style="font-size:48px; margin-bottom:12px;">
      🧸💗
    </div>

    <h1>My favourite person</h1>

    <p style="margin-bottom:24px;">
      There's something I hope you never forget...
    </p>

    <div class="card love-letter">
      <p>Hey, my love, ❤️</p>

      <p>
        <strong>I love you. So, so much.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        I know you are strong. I know you handle so much,
        even when things aren't easy and you don't always
        talk about what's going on inside your mind.
      </p>

      <p>
        But baby, you don't have to be strong every single
        moment. You are allowed to feel tired, confused,
        upset, or simply not okay.
      </p>

      <p>
        Whatever you are thinking, whatever the situation
        is, and no matter how difficult life gets, please
        remember that <strong>I'm here for you.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        I may not always have the perfect words or be able
        to fix everything, but I'll listen to you, believe
        in you, encourage you, and stand beside you.
        You don't have to figure everything out alone.
      </p>

      <p>
        On your good days, I'll celebrate you. On your
        difficult days, I'll remind you of the wonderful
        person you are. And on the days when you doubt
        yourself, I'll believe in you a little extra. 🫶🏻
      </p>

      <p>
        Please take care of yourself for me, okay?
        You matter so much more than you realise.
      </p>

      <p>
        No matter what today looks like, I hope you know
        how loved you are.
      </p>

      <div class="signature">
        You and me, okay? Always. ❤️
      </div>
    </div>

    <button onclick="showMore()">One last little thing 🥹</button>

    <div class="small-note">
      Made with all my love, just for you. ♡
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL SURPRISE -->
<section class="screen" id="third">
  <div class="content">
    <div style="font-size:75px;">🥹❤️</div>

    <h1>If you ever forget...</h1>

    <p style="font-size:19px; line-height:2;">
      You are loved.<br>
      You are enough.<br>
      You are capable of beautiful things.<br>
      And you will never have to earn my care
      by pretending to be okay.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <p style="font-size:18px; color:#b94c78;">
        A little reminder, for every difficult day:
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">
        I LOVE YOU. ❤️
      </h2>

      <p>Today, tomorrow, and through the messy in-between.</p>

      <div style="font-size:35px;">🫂💕🧸</div>
    </div>

    <button onclick="showScreen('second')">
      Read my letter again 💌
    </button>

    <div class="small-note">
      Sending you the biggest hug in the world. ♡
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
function showScreen(id) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(screen => {
    screen.classList.remove('active');
  });

  document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');
  window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
}

function openLove() {
  showScreen('second');
  createHearts(24);
}

function showMore() {
  showScreen('third');
  createHearts(35);
}

function createHearts(count) {
  const symbols = ['💗', '💕', '♡', '💖', '🩷'];

  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
    const heart = document.createElement('span');

    heart.className = 'floating-heart';
    heart.textContent =
      symbols[Math.floor(Math.random() * symbols.length)];

    heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
    heart.style.fontSize = (14 + Math.random() * 20) + 'px';
    heart.style.animationDuration = (3 + Math.random() * 4) + 's';
    heart.style.animationDelay = (Math.random() * 1.5) + 's';

    document.body.appendChild(heart);

    heart.addEventListener('animationend', () => heart.remove());
  }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
